Note on WinFsp:
WinFsp (Windows File System Proxy) headers/runtime are loaded dynamically
at runtime via FspLoad / LoadLibraryW from the user-installed WinFsp runtime
and remain subject to WinFsp's own license (GPLv3 with FOSS Exception).
